 "remarks": "Welcome home to sophisticated, effortless living in the heart of downtown Stamford. Nestled on the first floor of the desirable Mill River House, this beautifully maintained two-bedroom, two-bathroom residence offers 1,148 square feet of refined single-level space. As you step inside, 9-foot ceilings, gleaming new floors, and expansive windows flood the open-concept living and dining areas with rich natural light. At the center of it all is a well-appointed kitchen featuring sleek granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and a generous island-perfect for hosting friends or preparing weeknight dinners. When it's time to unwind, retreat to your private primary suite, complete with a spacious walk-in closet, a dedicated full bath, and sliding glass doors that open directly to your private balcony. Start your mornings here with a warm cup of coffee or decompress in the evening with fresh air and quiet relaxation. A spacious second bedroom with its own walk-in closet, an adjacent full hall bath, and a dedicated in-unit laundry room complete this thoughtfully designed layout. Beyond your front door, enjoy standard-setting amenities including a doorman, intercom, full fitness center, club room, and a beautifully landscaped courtyard with community grills. Plus parking spaces in the secure, gated garage and Mill River Park just across the street, you get the absolute best of both worlds: a tranquil retreat with vibrant city dining, shopping, and train",
